              </p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-orange-500">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-6 md:flex md:items-center md:justify-between">
          <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-6 text-gray-400 md:mt-0 md:order-1">
